{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:56:05+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:56:05+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Kemira Oyj","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","country":"Finland","city":"Helsinki","website":"https://www.kemira.com","employees":4828,"summary":"Kemira Oyj operates as a chemicals company in Finland, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Americas, and the Asia Pacific. It operates in three segments: Water Solutions, Packaging & Hygiene Solutions, and Fiber Essentials. It offers clean, safe, and affordable drinking water through efficient water processing, wastewater treatment, and reuse, supported by advanced digital technologies for customers in municipalities and water intensive industries. The company also provides functional and safe products enabled by efficient and compliant production processes and advanced digital technologies, serving customers in packaging, board, and tissue. In addition, it offers bright, clean, and strong pulp produced through efficient pulping and bleaching processes supported by advanced digital technologies for customers in pulp production. Kemira Oyj was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Helsinki, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Kemira Oyj opère en tant que société chimique en Finlande, dans le reste de l'Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Amérique et en Asie-Pacifique. Elle opère sur trois segments : Water Solutions, Packaging & Hygiene Solutions et Fiber Essentials. Il offre une eau potable propre, sûre et abordable grâce à un traitement efficace de l'eau, au traitement des eaux usées et à la réutilisation, soutenu par des technologies numériques avancées pour les clients des municipalités et des industries à forte consommation d'eau.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2181810432,"shares_out